{"kind":"finding","id":"F-019-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/MergeJournalForkMigrationTests.cs","line":206,"method":"NullArgs_ReturnSilently","category":"T1","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/MergeJournalOrchestrator.cs:909-910; delete BOTH null guards -> red (NRE at marker.InPlaceContinuation); delete either one alone -> green because the other guard returns first","what_it_asserts":"calling MigrateActiveReFlyForkIntoCommittedTree with both arguments null returns without throwing.","why_weak":"a single both-null call cannot discriminate either guard: marker==null returns before provisional is read, and with the marker guard gone the provisional==null guard returns; no assertion beyond absence of an exception.","proposed_action":"Split into two cells: (marker, null provisional) and (null marker, provisional), each asserting the no-op outcome (no committed-tree mutation, no migrate log).","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-019-02","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/RewindAbandonRetryProvisionalReapTests.cs","line":177,"method":"EmptyRpId_ReturnsZero","category":"T1","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/RewindInvoker.cs:2376; delete the IsNullOrEmpty(rpId) early return -> stays green (the rp_target orphan cannot equal a null/empty rpId, so the scan also returns 0); seed an orphan with ProvisionalForRpId=null -> red","what_it_asserts":"ReapPriorProvisionalsForRp returns 0 and leaves a recording whose ProvisionalForRpId is rp_target when called with a null or empty rpId.","why_weak":"no fixture recording carries a null/empty ProvisionalForRpId, so the mismatch test alone yields zero victims; the early return the name targets is never load-bearing.","proposed_action":"Add an orphan with ProvisionalForRpId = null (or empty) and assert it survives; only the early return then prevents the reap.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"RewindInvoker","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/RewindInvoker.cs","sut_line":2433,"case_kind":"state-transition","proposed_name":"ReapPriorProvisionalsForRp_RemovesFromPendingTree","sketch":"RecordingStore.StashPendingTree(a tree containing the orphan provisional); call ReapPriorProvisionalsForRp('rp_target','sess_new'); assert the tree's Recordings no longer contains the orphan and the INFO line carries removedFromPendingTree=True.","guards":"Only the committed-tree removal arm is asserted today; dropping the PendingTree removal at RewindInvoker.cs:2433 leaves an orphan that FinalizeTreeCommit re-adds to the committed list (the s11 evidence case in PendingTree form).","risk":"recording"}
